#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:5
msgid "Reload summary"
msgstr "重新加载汇总表"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:7
msgid ""
"When any `folio`_ is added or any `folio property`_ is edited, the changes "
"are not updated at the summary automatically. To update the `folio "
"properties`_ at the summary, the summary has to be reload."
msgstr ""
"当添加任何 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 或编辑任何 `图幅属性 <folio property_>`_ "
"时，更改不会自动在汇总表中更新。要在汇总表中更新 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_，必须重新加载汇总表。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:10
msgid "To reload the summary:"
msgstr "重新加载汇总表："

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select the summary table, or one of the summary tables if there is more than"
" one, to display the summary properties at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"选择汇总表（如果有多个，则选择其中一个），以在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 中显示汇总表属性。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:13
msgid "Go to **Content** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Content** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click |view-refresh| **Reload** button to update `folio properties`_ at "
"summary."
msgstr "点击 |view-refresh| **重新加载** 按钮，以在汇总表中更新 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:21
msgid "view-refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

#: ../../source/users/reports/summary/reload_summary.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech summary properties panel, content tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 汇总表属性面板，内容标签页"
